allback Invariant", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Precision landing must use visual H-centering only. Vision loss, centering failure or blind-descent timeout stops motion and enters error handling; PX4 LAND is never substituted, to avoid an unverified automatic mode during a visual task."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_v1_v4_message_isolation", "label": "PX4 v1/v4 Message Isolation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_servo_pwm_sequence", "label": "Servo PWM Drop Sequence (1150\u21921700\u21922150 \u00b5s)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_architecture_model_lifecycle", "label": "On-Demand Vision Model Loading/Release", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The drop model is released (close + deref + GC) when the mission enters the recon stage, and the landing model is loaded on demand, to avoid wasted VRAM and dangling handles outside the phases that need each model."}, {"id": "docs_architecture_fsm_px4_process_split", "label": "FSM\u2013PX4 Process Split via StandaloneBridge Relay", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ARCHITECTURE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The task FSM and px4_bridge are separate ROS 2 processes: FSM \u2192 StandaloneBridge \u2192 /drone/cmd_* relay topics \u2192 px4_bridge \u2192 PX4 DDS. This keeps mission logic decoupled from the DDS adapter and lets t